# German translation of ConsoleUI (Story 6.6).
# English is the source language. This one catalog serves both sides: Slint bundles it for @tr()
# in the .slint files (crates/shell/build.rs), consoleui_core::i18n embeds it for strings built in
# Rust. The test `i18n::tests::catalog_matches_sources` fails on missing or stale messages.
# Placeholders: {} next argument, {0}/{1} a specific one, {n} the count of a plural.
